WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:17.137
"It's a good day for picking berries!" Dad said.

2
00:00:17.138 --> 00:00:20.672
The family was at a farm.

3
00:00:20.673 --> 00:00:24.643
There were rows of blueberry bushes.

4
00:00:24.644 --> 00:00:29.520
Everyone had a bucket.

5
00:00:29.521 --> 00:00:36.323
Harry ate several blueberries. "Mmm!"

6
00:00:36.324 --> 00:00:43.730
Emmy ate a few berries too. "Delicious!"

7
00:00:43.731 --> 00:00:50.534
Then Dad and Oliver ate some.

8
00:00:50.535 --> 00:00:52.961
Mom frowned.

9
00:00:52.962 --> 00:00:56.631
"Don't eat the berries now," she said.

10
00:00:56.632 --> 00:01:00.116
"I want to take lots of berries home.

11
00:01:00.117 --> 00:01:06.176
We will cook blueberry pancakes and blueberry pie."

12
00:01:06.177 --> 00:01:11.383
"Yum!" Harry and Emmy said.

13
00:01:11.384 --> 00:01:17.053
"I love blueberry pancakes and pie!" Oliver said.

14
00:01:17.054 --> 00:01:20.208
Oliver picked some ripe berries.

15
00:01:20.209 --> 00:01:25.001
"Pancakes and pie," Oliver said to himself.

16
00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:29.608
He put all the berries into his bucket.

17
00:01:29.609 --> 00:01:32.475
Emmy picked lots of berries.

18
00:01:32.476 --> 00:01:39.515
"Pancakes and pie," she said to herself.

19
00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:42.966
Her bucket got full quickly.

20
00:01:42.967 --> 00:01:45.678
Harry picked five berries.

21
00:01:45.679 --> 00:01:48.776
Then he ate just one.

22
00:01:48.777 --> 00:01:56.713
He did this over and over again.

23
00:01:56.714 --> 00:02:02.122
He filled his bucket.

24
00:02:02.123 --> 00:02:08.360
Dad picked lots of berries.

25
00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:12.617
Then he ate a big handful.

26
00:02:12.618 --> 00:02:16.620
"Dad!" Oliver said.

27
00:02:16.621 --> 00:02:20.908
"Pancakes and pie!"

28
00:02:20.909 --> 00:02:23.870
"Sorry!" Dad said.

29
00:02:23.871 --> 00:02:32.726
He put the rest of the berries in his bucket.

30
00:02:32.727 --> 00:02:36.531
"My bucket is full," Emmy said.

31
00:02:36.532 --> 00:02:41.064
"So is mine," Harry said.

32
00:02:41.065 --> 00:02:48.561
Dad and Oliver had full buckets too.

33
00:02:48.562 --> 00:02:55.237
Everyone looked at Mom.

34
00:02:55.238 --> 00:03:02.155
Her lips were blue.

35
00:03:02.156 --> 00:03:07.951
Her bucket wasn't full.

36
00:03:07.952 --> 00:03:17.669
"Oops!" said Mom.
